{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣女星蔡瑞雪上個月剛滿30歲，昨日（24日）卻毫無預警拋出震撼彈，在社交平台宣布閃婚醫美醫生，並寫道：「婚後日記」，更上載了一輯結婚相，當中還有兩人抱着愛犬「一家三口」的合照，突如其來的消息震驚網民。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T20:24:20.907008+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T20:01:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T20:17:34.686375+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T20:17:34.686375+00:00","content_hash":"ff0900dbafc40c13ff68cb98d852fcc3065bcba252cc83961dadb8c4d76709eb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}